= Group responsibilities

Keep the supervisor informed about project progress and challenges.

Regularly meet with the supervisor.

Give adequate notice about changes with meeting availability.

Seek guidance and clarification on project-related issues.

Act on the supervisor's feedback and recommendations.

Maintain clear communication with the supervisor.

= Supervisor responsibilities

Provide guidance and support to the project group throughout the semester.

Offer advice on project planning, execution, and problem-solving.

Review and provide feedback on project milestones, reports and presentations.

Be accessible for regular meetings and respond to group inquiries in a timely manner.

Maintain clear communication with the group members.
